е проверяют полные пользовательские потоки с помощью автоматизации браузера","ar":"الاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية هي اختبارات تحقق من تدفقات المستخدم الكاملة مع تلقيم متصفح"},"features":{"en":["Activates end-to-end testing conventions using Playwright","Validates complete user flows with browser automation","Supports Page Object Model classes for efficient testing","Works with authentication contexts for secure testing","Automates testing for files in tests/e2e/specs/ and tests/e2e/pages/","Uses file patterns like tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts and tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts"],"zh":["使用 Playwright 实现自动化测试","支持创建和修改 Page Object Model 类","支持测试完整的用户流程","支持 authentication 上下文","文件模式匹配：`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts`","文件模式匹配：`tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`"],"ja":["Playwright を使用した自動テストの実現","Page Object Model クラスの作成と変更のサポート","完全なユーザーフローのテストのサポート","認証コンテキストのサポート","ファイルパターンマッチング：`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts`","ファイルパターンマッチング：`tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`"],"ko":["Playwright를 사용한 자동화 테스트 구현","Page Object Model 클래스의 생성과 수정 지원","완전한 사용자 흐름의 테스트 지원","인증 컨텍스트 지원","파일 패턴 매칭: `tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts`","파일 패턴 매칭: `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`"],"es":["Validación de flujos de usuario completos con Playwright","Automatización de navegador para pruebas e2e","Compatibilidad con Page Object Model","Soporte para contextos de autenticación","Patrones de archivo para tests e2e","Integración con especiales de testing"],"fr":["Validation de flux d''utilisateur complets avec Playwright","Automatisation de navigateur pour les tests e2e","Compatibilité avec Page Object Model","Support pour les contextes d''authentification","Modèles de fichiers pour les tests e2e","Intégration avec des spéciales de testing"],"de":["Validierung komplexer Benutzerflüsse mit Playwright","Browser-Automatisierung für E2E-Tests","Kompatibilität mit Page Object Model","Unterstützung für Authentifizierungskontexte","Dateimuster für E2E-Tests","Integration mit Test-Spezialisten"],"pt":["Validação de fluxos de usuário com automação de navegador","Suporte a Page Object Model","Trabalho com contextos de autenticação","Integração com Playwright","Testes de especificação com arquivos `.spec.ts`","Criação e modificação de classes de página com arquivos `.page.ts`"],"ru":["Проверка пользовательских потоков с помощью автоматизации браузера","Поддержка модели объекта страницы","Работа с контекстами аутентификации","Интеграция с Playwright","Тестирование спецификаций с файлами `.spec.ts`","Создание и изменение классов страницы с файлами `.page.ts`"],"ar":["تحقق من تدفقات المستخدم مع تلقيم متصفح","دعم نموذج كائن الصفحة","العمل مع سياقات المصادقة","التكامل مع Playwright","اختبار المواصفات مع الملفات `.spec.ts`","إنشاء وتعديل فصول الصفحة مع الملفات `.page.ts`"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use e2e-testing","e2e-testing setup guide","end-to-end testing with Playwright","e2e-testing vs Selenium","e2e-testing install","what is e2e-testing","e2e-testing alternative","Playwright e2e testing","e2e testing best practices"],"zh":["E2E 测试","Playwright","自动化测试","Page Object Model","authentication 上下文","AI エージェント","Web 开发","测试自动化","JavaScript 测试"],"ja":["E2E テスト","Playwright","自動テスト","Page Object Model","認証コンテキスト","AIエージェント","Web 開発","テスト自動化","JavaScript テスト"],"ko":["E2E 테스트","Playwright","자동화 테스트","Page Object Model","인증 컨텍스트","AI 에이전트","웹 개발","테스트 자동화","JavaScript 테스트"],"es":["pruebas e2e","testing con Playwright","automatización de navegador","Page Object Model","autenticación en pruebas","patrones de archivo para tests","herramientas de testing","desarrollo de software","calidad de código"],"fr":["tests e2e","testing avec Playwright","automatisation de navigateur","Page Object Model","authentification dans les tests","modèles de fichiers pour les tests","outils de testing","développement de logiciels","qualité de code"],"de":["E2E-Tests","Testing mit Playwright","Browser-Automatisierung","Page Object Model","Authentifizierung in Tests","Dateimuster für E2E-Tests","Test-Tools","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität"],"pt":["testes e2e","playwright","automação de navegador","fluxos de usuário","page object model","contextos de autenticação","teste de software","desenvolvimento de software","e2e testing"],"ru":["E2E-тестирование","playwright","автоматизация браузера","пользовательские потоки","модель объекта страницы","контексты аутентификации","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["الاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية","playwright","تلقيم متصفح","تدفقات المستخدم","نموذج كائن الصفحة","سياقات المصادقة","اختبار البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"JasonPaff","repo":"head-shakers","repoPath":"JasonPaff/head-shakers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.317Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"e2e-testing","description":"Enforces project E2E testing conventions using Playwright with custom fixtures, Page Object Model, and authentication contexts.","bodyPreview":"# E2E Testing Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides end-to-end testing conventions using Playwright. E2E tests validate complete user flows with browser automation.\n\n## Activation\n\nThis skill activates when:\n\n- Creating or modifying files in `tests/e2e/specs/`\n- Testing complete user flows\n- Working with Playwright\n- Creating or modifying Page Object Model classes\n- Working with authentication contexts\n\n## File Patterns\n\n- `tests/e2e/specs/**/*.spec.ts`\n- `tests/e2e/pages/**/*.page.ts`\n\n## Work","body":"# E2E Testing Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides end-to-end testing conventions using Playwright. E2E tests validate complete user flows with browser automation.\n\n## Activation\n\nThis skill activates when:\n\n- Creating or modifying files in `tests/e2e/specs/`\n- Testing complete user flows\n- Working with Playwright\n- Creating or modifying Page Object Model classes\n- Working with authentication contexts\n\n## File Patterns\n\n- `tests/e2e/specs/**/*.spec.ts`\n- `tests/e2e/pages/**/*.page.ts`\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Detect E2E test work (file path contains `tests/e2e/`)\n2. Load `references/E2E-Testing-Conventions.md`\n3. Also load `testing-base` skill for shared conventions\n4. Apply Playwright patterns with custom fixtures\n5. Use Page Object Model for reusable interactions\n\n## Key Patterns (REQUIRED)\n\n### Custom Fixtures\n\n- Use fixtures from `tests/e2e/fixtures/base.fixture.ts`\n- Available: `adminPage`, `userPage`, `newUserPage` (authenticated contexts)\n- Available: `adminFinder`, `userFinder`, `newUserFinder` (ComponentFinder instances)\n\n### Page Object Model\n\n- Extend `BasePage` class for page objects\n- Define `url` property for navigation\n- Use `byTestId` helper for data-testid lookups\n\n### ComponentFinder\n\n- Use for standardized `data-testid` lookups\n- Methods: `feature()`, `form()`, `ui()`, `layout()`, `tableCell()`\n\n### Test Organization\n\n- Place in appropriate `tests/e2e/specs/{category}/` folder\n- Categories: smoke, public, user, admin, onboarding\n\n## References\n\n- `references/E2E-Testing-Conventions.md` - Complete E2E testing conventions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:53.088Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for QA Agents needing advanced end-to-end testing capabilities with Playwright","zh":"非常适合需要使用Playwright进行高级端到端测试功能的QA代理","ja":"Playwrightを使用した高度なエンドツーエンドテスト機能を必要とするQAエージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright를 사용하여 고급의 엔드 투 엔드 테스트 기능을 필요한 QA 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de QA que necesitan capacidades de pruebas de extremo a extremo avanzadas con Playwright","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de QA ayant besoin de capacités de test de bout en bout avancées avec Playwright","de":"Perfekt für QA-Agenten, die erweiterte End-to-End-Testfunktionen mit Playwright benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de QA que precisam de capacidades de teste de ponta a ponta avançadas com Playwright","ru":"Идеально для агентов QA, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности комплексного тестирования с помощью Playwright","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الجودة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات اختبار متقدمة من النهاية إلى النهاية مع Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate complete user flows with browser automation using Playwright, supporting Page Object Model classes and authentication contexts, and working with files like `.spec.ts` and `.page.ts`","zh":"赋予代理人使用Playwright进行浏览器自动化来验证完整的用户流程的能力，支持页面对象模型类和身份验证上下文，并处理类似`.spec.ts`和`.page.ts`的文件","ja":"Playwrightを使用したブラウザ自動化によって、ページオブジェクトモデルクラスや認証コンテキストをサポートし、`.spec.ts`や`.page.ts`などのファイルを操作して、エージェントが完璧なユーザーフローを検証できるようにする","ko":"Playwright를 사용하여 브라우저 자동화를 통해 완전한 사용자 흐름을 검증할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여함. 페이지 객체 모델 클래스와 인증 컨텍스트를 지원하며 `.spec.ts` 및 `.page.ts`와 같은 파일을 처리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar flujos de usuario completos con automatización de navegador utilizando Playwright, admitiendo clases de modelo de objeto de página y contextos de autenticación, y trabajando con archivos como `.spec.ts` y `.page.ts`","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider des flux d''utilisateurs complets avec une automatisation de navigateur utilisant Playwright, en prenant en charge les classes de modèle d''objet de page et les contextes d''authentification, et en travaillant avec des fichiers tels que `.spec.ts` et `.page.ts`","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Benutzerflüsse mit Browserautomatisierung unter Verwendung von Playwright zu validieren, unterstützt Page Object Model-Klassen und Authentifizierungskontexte und arbeitet mit Dateien wie `.spec.ts` und `.page.ts`","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar fluxos de usuário completos com automação de navegador usando Playwright, suportando classes de modelo de objeto de página e contextos de autenticação, e trabalhando com arquivos como `.spec.ts` e `.page.ts`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять полные потоки пользователей с помощью автоматизации браузера, используя Playwright, поддерживая классы модели объекта страницы и контексты аутентификации, и работающие с файлами, такими как `.spec.ts` и `.page.ts`","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التحقق من تدفقات المستخدم الكاملة مع تلقيم تلقائي للمتصفح باستخدام Playwright، ودعم فئات نموذج كائن الصفحة وسياقات التحقق، والعمل مع الملفات مثل `.spec.ts` و `.page.ts`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating user flow testing","Debugging browser interactions","Generating test specs with Playwright"],"zh":["自动化用户流测试","调试浏览器交互","使用Playwright生成测试规格"],"ja":["ユーザーフロー試験の自動化","ブラウザの相互作用のデバッグ","Playwrightを使用した試験仕様の生成"],"ko":["사용자 흐름 테스트 자동화","브라우저 상호작용 디버깅","Playwright를 사용한 테스트 사양 생성"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de flujo de usuario","Depuración de interacciones del navegador","Generación de especificaciones de pruebas con Playwright"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de flux d''utilisateur","Débogage des interactions de navigateur","Génération de spécifications de test avec Playwright"],"de":["Automatisierung von Benutzerfluss-Tests","Fehlerbehebung bei Browser-Interaktionen","Erstellung von Test-Spezifikationen mit Playwright"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de fluxo de usuário","Depurar interações de navegador","Gerar especificações de teste com Playwright"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования потоков пользователей","Отладка взаимодействий браузера","Генерация спецификаций тестирования с помощью Playwright"],"ar":["تحويل اختبار تدفق المستخدم إلى تلقائي","تصحيح أخطاء تفاعلات المتصفح","توليد مواصفات الاختبار مع Playwright"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright installation","Limited to browser automation","Specific file patterns required (`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` and `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`)"],"zh":["需要安装Playwright","仅限浏览器自动化","需要特定的文件模式(`tests/e2e/specs/*.spec.ts`和`tests/e2e/pages/*.page.ts`)"],"ja":["Playwrightのインストールが必要","ブラウザ自動化のみ","特定のファイルパターン(`tests/e2e/specs/*.spec.ts`と`tests/e2e/pages/*.page.ts`)が必要"],"ko":["Playwright 설치가 필요","브라우저 자동화만 지원","특정 파일 패턴(`tests/e2e/specs/*.spec.ts` 및 `tests/e2e/pages/*.page.ts`)이 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Playwright","Limitado a la automatización del navegador","Patrones de archivo específicos requeridos (`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` y `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Playwright","Limité à l''automatisation du navigateur","Modèles de fichiers spécifiques requis (`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` et `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`)"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Playwright","Begrenzt auf Browserautomatisierung","Spezifische Dateimuster erforderlich (`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` und `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`)"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Playwright","Limitado à automação de navegador","Padrões de arquivo específicos necessários (`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` e `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`)"],"ru":["Требуется установка Playwright","Ограниченная автоматизация браузера","Требуются специфические шаблоны файлов (`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` и `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Playwright","محدود بالتلقيم التلقائي للمتصفح","أنماط ملفات محددة مطلوبة (`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` و `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7e98c04e562089716aa5213864ee0f19cbdf3565603f565a8da13aa9ac51c279","qualityScore":23}');
