INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('JasonPaff/head-shakers/e2e-testing', 'e2e-testing', 'JasonPaff', 'head-shakers', 'community', 'e2e-testing JasonPaff head-shakers community The e2e-testing skill provides end-to-end testing conventions for validating complete user flows with browser automation using Playwright, benefiting developers and QA engineers. E2E 测试技能提供了使用 Playwright 的端到端测试约定，用于验证完整的用户流程 E2E テストスキルは Playwright を使用した端から端までのテスト規約を提供し、完全なユーザーフローを検証する E2E 테스트 스킬은 Playwright를 사용한 종단간 테스트 규약을 제공하여 완전한 사용자 흐름을 검증합니다 El skill de pruebas e2e proporciona convenciones de testing con Playwright para validar flujos de usuario completos Le skill de tests e2e fournit des conventions de testing avec Playwright pour valider les flux d''utilisateur complets Das E2E-Testing-Skill bietet Testkonventionen mit Playwright, um komplexe Benutzerflüsse zu validieren O skill de testes E2E fornece convenções de testes com Playwright para validação de fluxos de usuário Навык E2E-тестирования предоставляет конвенции для тестирования с Playwright для проверки пользовательских потоков مهارة الاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية توفر اتفاقيات للاختبار مع Playwright لتحقق من تدفقات المستخدم how to use e2e-testing e2e-testing setup guide end-to-end testing with Playwright e2e-testing vs Selenium e2e-testing install what is e2e-testing e2e-testing alternative Playwright e2e testing e2e testing best practices E2E 测试 Playwright 自动化测试 Page Object Model authentication 上下文 AI エージェント Web 开发 测试自动化 JavaScript 测试 Activates end-to-end testing conventions using Playwright Validates complete user flows with browser automation Supports Page Object Model classes for efficient testing Works with authentication contexts for secure testing Automates testing for files in tests/e2e/specs/ and tests/e2e/pages/ Uses file patterns like tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts and tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts e2e-testing is a skill that provides end-to-end testing conventions using Playwright for validating complete user flows with browser automation.');
