actualizar intenciones de aplicaciones en iOS y macOS de forma eficiente","fr":"Appintents-updates est un skill qui permet de mettre à jour les intentions d''applications sur iOS et macOS de manière efficace","de":"Appintents-updates ist ein Skill, der die effiziente Aktualisierung von App-Intentionen in iOS- und macOS-Anwendungen ermöglicht","pt":"App Intents Updates é um conjunto de instruções para adicionar ou atualizar intenções de aplicativos em iOS e macOS","ru":"App Intents Updates - это набор инструкций для добавления или обновления намерений приложений в iOS и macOS","ar":"App Intents Updates هو مجموعة من الإرشادات لإضافة أو تحديث نوايا التطبيقات على أجهزة iOS و macOS"},"features":{"en":["Provides instruction-driven Swift MVC repo for UIKit and AppKit apps","Supports shared Framework logic for efficient app development","Ensures intent execution is fast, deterministic, and cancellable","Utilizes OSLog/Logger with privacy annotations for secure logging","Preferably uses Core services or side controllers for shared logic"],"zh":["支持UIKit（iOS）和AppKit（macOS）应用","提供共享框架逻辑","优化intent执行速度和确定性","支持OSLog/Logger和隐私注释","可取消的intent执行"],"ja":["UIKit（iOS）とAppKit（macOS）アプリをサポート","共有フレームワークロジックを提供","intent実行の高速化と決定性","OSLog/Loggerとプライバシーアノテーションをサポート","キャンセル可能なintent実行"],"ko":["UIKit（iOS） 및 AppKit（macOS） 애플리케이션 지원","공유 프레임워크 논리를 제공","인테ント 실행 속도 및 결정성 최적화","OSLog/Logger 및 개인 정보 注释 지원","취소 가능한 인테ント 실행"],"es":["Integración con UIKit y AppKit","Lógica de intención independiente de la interfaz de usuario","Ejecución de intenciones rápida, determinista y cancelable","Registro de logs con OSLog/Logger y anotaciones de privacidad","Compatibilidad con Spotlight y otros comportamientos del sistema"],"fr":["Intégration avec UIKit et AppKit","Logique d''intention indépendante de l''interface utilisateur","Exécution d''intentions rapide, déterministe et annulable","Journalisation avec OSLog/Logger et annotations de confidentialité","Compatibilité avec Spotlight et d''autres comportements du système"],"de":["Integration mit UIKit und AppKit","Intensionslogik unabhängig von der Benutzeroberfläche","Ausführung von Intentionen schnell, deterministisch und abbrechbar","Log-Aufzeichnung mit OSLog/Logger und Datenschutz-Anmerkungen","Kompatibilität mit Spotlight und anderen Systemverhaltensweisen"],"pt":["Lógica compartilhada para UIKit e AppKit","Suporte a Spotlight integration","Execução de intenções rápida e determinística","Uso de OSLog/Logger com anotações de privacidade","Compatibilidade com iOS e macOS"],"ru":["Общая логика для UIKit и AppKit","Поддержка интеграции Spotlight","Быстрая и детерминированная исполнение намерений","Использование OSLog/Logger с аннотациями конфиденциальности","Совместимость с iOS и macOS"],"ar":["منطق مشترك ل UIKit و AppKit","دعم تكامل Spotlight","تنفيذ نوايا سريع و محدد","استخدام OSLog/Logger مع تعليقات على الخصوصية","التوافق مع iOS و macOS"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use appintents-updates","appintents-updates setup guide","Swift MVC repository for App Intents","appintents-updates vs other iOS development tools","installing appintents-updates for macOS app development","appintents-updates alternative for UIKit and AppKit integration"],"zh":["appintents-updates","AI工具","iOS开发","macOS开发","App Intents","Spotlight集成","系统行为优化"],"ja":["appintents-updates","AIエージェント","iOS開発","macOS開発","App Intents","Spotlight統合","システム動作最適化"],"ko":["appintents-updates","AI 에이전트","iOS 개발","macOS 개발","App Intents","Spotlight 통합","시스템 동작 최적화"],"es":["appintents-updates","iOS","macOS","UIKit","AppKit","intenciones de aplicaciones","actualización de intenciones","mejores prácticas de desarrollo","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["appintents-updates","iOS","macOS","UIKit","AppKit","intentions d''applications","mise à jour d''intentions","bonnes pratiques de développement","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["appintents-updates","iOS","macOS","UIKit","AppKit","App-Intentionen","Aktualisierung von Intentionen","beste Praktiken für Entwicklung","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen"],"pt":["App Intents Updates","desenvolvimento de iOS","desenvolvimento de macOS","UIKit","AppKit","Spotlight integration","OSLog/Logger","privacidade de dados"],"ru":["App Intents Updates","разработка приложений для iOS","разработка приложений для macOS","UIKit","AppKit","интеграция Spotlight","OSLog/Logger","конфиденциальность данных"],"ar":["App Intents Updates","تطوير التطبيقات لنظام iOS","تطوير التطبيقات لنظام macOS","UIKit","AppKit","تكامل Spotlight","OSLog/Logger","الخصوصية البيانية"]}},"owner":"cleanbit","repo":"agents-appkit-uikit","repoPath":"cleanbit/agents-appkit-uikit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.329Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"appintents-updates","description":"App Intents updates and system integration guidance for UIKit/AppKit apps.","bodyPreview":"# App Intents Updates\n\nUse this skill when adding or updating App Intents, snippets, Spotlight integration, or related system behaviors.\n\n## Priority\n- If this skill conflicts with local repo skills or `AGENTS.md`, follow those.\n\n## Guidance\n- Keep intent logic UI-independent; prefer Core services or side controllers for shared logic.\n- Ensure intent execution is fast, deterministic, and cancellable.\n- Use OSLog/Logger with privacy annotations; never log user content or secrets.\n- Prefer platfor","body":"# App Intents Updates\n\nUse this skill when adding or updating App Intents, snippets, Spotlight integration, or related system behaviors.\n\n## Priority\n- If this skill conflicts with local repo skills or `AGENTS.md`, follow those.\n\n## Guidance\n- Keep intent logic UI-independent; prefer Core services or side controllers for shared logic.\n- Ensure intent execution is fast, deterministic, and cancellable.\n- Use OSLog/Logger with privacy annotations; never log user content or secrets.\n- Prefer platform-native UI (UIKit/AppKit); SwiftUI is forbidden in this repo.\n\n## References\n- Read `references/AppIntents-Updates.md` for detailed API changes and examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:08.349Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for iOS and macOS Development Agents needing efficient App Intents management using Swift MVC.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的App Intents管理的iOS和macOS开发代理，使用Swift MVC。","ja":"Swift MVCを使用して効率的なApp Intents管理が必要なiOSとmacOS開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Swift MVC를 사용하여 효율적인 App Intents 관리가 필요한 iOS 및 macOS 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de iOS y macOS que necesitan un manejo eficiente de App Intents utilizando Swift MVC.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement iOS et macOS ayant besoin d''une gestion efficace des App Intents en utilisant Swift MVC.","de":"Perfekt für iOS- und macOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine effiziente App-Intents-Verwaltung mit Swift MVC benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do iOS e macOS que necessitam de gerenciamento eficiente de App Intents usando Swift MVC.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки iOS и macOS, которым требуется эффективное управление App Intents с использованием Swift MVC.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير لنظامي iOS و macOS الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة كفؤة لنوايا التطبيق باستخدام Swift MVC."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage App Intents, snippets, and Spotlight integration with fast, deterministic, and cancellable intent execution, utilizing Core services, side controllers, and OSLog/Logger with privacy annotations.","zh":"赋予代理管理App Intents、代码片段和Spotlight集成的能力，具有快速、确定性和可取消的意图执行，利用Core服务、侧控制器和OSLog/Logger以及隐私注释。","ja":"エージェントにApp Intents、スニペット、Spotlight統合を管理する能力を付与し、高速で決定性があり、キャンセル可能なインテントの実行を提供し、Coreサービス、サイドコントローラ、およびOSLog/Loggerとプライバシーアノテーションを利用します。","ko":"에이전트에 App Intents, 코드 조각 및 Spotlight 통합을 관리할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, 빠르고 결정적이며 취소 가능한 의도 실행을 제공하고, Core 서비스, 측면 컨트롤러 및 OSLog/Logger 및 개인 정보 주석을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar App Intents, fragmentos de código y la integración de Spotlight con una ejecución de intención rápida, determinista y cancelable, utilizando servicios básicos, controladores laterales y OSLog/Logger con anotaciones de privacidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les App Intents, les extraits de code et l''intégration de Spotlight avec une exécution d''intention rapide, déterministe et annulable, en utilisant des services de base, des contrôleurs latéraux et OSLog/Logger avec des annotations de confidentialité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, App-Intents, Code-Snippets und Spotlight-Integration mit schneller, deterministischer und abbrechbarer Intention-Ausführung zu verwalten, indem Core-Dienste, Seiten-Controller und OSLog/Logger mit Datenschutz-Anmerkungen verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar App Intents, trechos de código e integração com Spotlight com execução de intenção rápida, determinística e cancelável, utilizando serviços Core, controladores laterais e OSLog/Logger com anotações de privacidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять App Intents, фрагментами кода и интеграцией со Spotlight с быстрой, детерминированной и отменяемой выполнением намерений, используя сервисы Core, боковые контроллеры и OSLog/Logger с аннотациями конфиденциальности.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إدارة نوايا التطبيق وأجزاء الشفرة ودمجها مع Spotlight مع تنفيذ سريع و محدد و قابل للإلغاء للنوايا، باستخدام خدمات Core و التحكم الجانبي و OSLog/Logger مع ملاحظات الخصوصية."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating App Intents for iOS and macOS apps","Generating snippets for UIKit and AppKit","Debugging Spotlight integration issues"],"zh":["为iOS和macOS应用程序更新App Intents","为UIKit和AppKit生成代码片段","调试Spotlight集成问题"],"ja":["iOSとmacOSアプリケーションのApp Intentsを更新する","UIKitとAppKitのスニペットを生成する","Spotlight統合の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["iOS 및 macOS 애플리케이션에 대한 App Intents 업데이트","UIKit 및 AppKit에 대한 코드 조각 생성","Spotlight 통합 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Actualización de App Intents para aplicaciones de iOS y macOS","Generación de fragmentos de código para UIKit y AppKit","Depuración de problemas de integración de Spotlight"],"fr":["Mise à jour des App Intents pour les applications iOS et macOS","Génération d''extraits de code pour UIKit et AppKit","Débogage des problèmes d''intégration de Spotlight"],"de":["Aktualisierung von App-Intents für iOS- und macOS-Apps","Generierung von Code-Snippets für UIKit und AppKit","Fehlerbehebung bei Spotlight-Integration-Problemen"],"pt":["Atualizar App Intents para aplicativos iOS e macOS","Gerar trechos de código para UIKit e AppKit","Depurar problemas de integração com Spotlight"],"ru":["Обновление App Intents для приложений iOS и macOS","Генерация фрагментов кода для UIKit и AppKit","Отладка проблем интеграции со Spotlight"],"ar":["تحديث نوايا التطبيق لتطبيقات iOS و macOS","генерация أجزاء من الشفرة لـ UIKit و AppKit","تصحيح أخطاء دمج Spotlight"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Swift MVC knowledge","Limited to iOS and macOS development","Conflicts with local repo skills or AGENTS.md may require prioritization"],"zh":["需要Swift MVC知识","仅限于iOS和macOS开发","可能与本地仓库技能或AGENTS.md冲突，可能需要优先级"],"ja":["Swift MVCの知識が必要","iOSとmacOSの開発に限定","ローカルリポジトリのスキルまたはAGENTS.mdと競合する可能性があり、優先順位の指定が必要になる場合があります"],"ko":["Swift MVC 지식이 필요합니다.","iOS 및 macOS 개발에만 제한됩니다.","로컬 저장소 스킬 또는 AGENTS.md와 충돌할 수 있으며, 우선 순위 지정이 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Swift MVC","Limitado al desarrollo de iOS y macOS","Conflicto con habilidades del repositorio local o AGENTS.md puede requerir priorización"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Swift MVC","Limité au développement iOS et macOS","Conflit avec les compétences du référentiel local ou AGENTS.md peut nécessiter une priorisation"],"de":["Benötigt Swift-MVC-Kenntnisse","Begrenzt auf iOS- und macOS-Entwicklung","Konflikt mit lokalen Repo-Fähigkeiten oder AGENTS.md kann Priorisierung erfordern"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de Swift MVC","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de iOS e macOS","Conflitos com habilidades do repositório local ou AGENTS.md podem exigir priorização"],"ru":["Требуется знание Swift MVC","Ограничен 