INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('cleanbit/agents-appkit-uikit/appintents-updates', 'appintents-updates', 'cleanbit', 'agents-appkit-uikit', 'community', 'appintents-updates cleanbit agents-appkit-uikit community The appintents-updates skill enables developers to efficiently manage App Intents, snippets, and Spotlight integration for iOS and macOS apps using Swift MVC. It benefits developers working with UIKit and AppKit appintents-updates是一个用于添加或更新App Intents、代码片段、Spotlight集成和相关系统行为的技能 appintents-updatesは、App Intents、コードスニペット、Spotlight統合、または関連するシステム動作を追加または更新するためのスキルです appintents-updates는 App Intents, 코드 조각, Spotlight 통합 및 관련 시스템 동작을 추가 또는 업데이트하는 데 사용되는 스킬입니다 El skill appintents-updates proporciona una forma eficiente de actualizar intenciones de aplicaciones en iOS y macOS, utilizando UIKit y AppKit. Le skill appintents-updates offre un moyen efficace de mettre à jour les intentions d''applications sur iOS et macOS, en utilisant UIKit et AppKit. Der Skill appintents-updates bietet eine effiziente Methode, um App-Intentionen in iOS- und macOS-Anwendungen zu aktualisieren, unter Verwendung von UIKit und AppKit. O App Intents Updates é um repositório de código aberto para UIKit e AppKit que fornece lógica compartilhada para desenvolvedores de iOS e macOS. App Intents Updates - это открытое хранилище кода для UIKit и AppKit, предоставляющее общую логику для разработчиков iOS и macOS. App Intents Updates هو مستودع رمز مفتوح المصدر ل UIKit و AppKit يوفر منطقًا مشتركًا للمطورين how to use appintents-updates appintents-updates setup guide Swift MVC repository for App Intents appintents-updates vs other iOS development tools installing appintents-updates for macOS app development appintents-updates alternative for UIKit and AppKit integration appintents-updates AI工具 iOS开发 macOS开发 App Intents Spotlight集成 系统行为优化 Provides instruction-driven Swift MVC repo for UIKit and AppKit apps Supports shared Framework logic for efficient app development Ensures intent execution is fast, deterministic, and cancellable Utilizes OSLog/Logger with privacy annotations for secure logging Preferably uses Core services or side controllers for shared logic appintents-updates is a Swift MVC repository for updating App Intents, snippets, and related system behaviors in iOS and macOS apps');
