ón de Temporal Rust SDK para desarroll...","fr":"Guide de mise en route de Temporal Rust SDK pour les déve...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Temporal Rust SDK für Entwickler","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Temporal Rust SDK","ru":"Настройка ИИ Агентов: Temporal Rust SDK Руководство","ar":"دليل إعداد أداة Temporal Rust SDK"},"description":{"en":"Unlock efficient Temporal prototype development with the temporal-rust-sdk. Get started now and streamline your workflow with our expert guide!","zh":"使用 Temporal Rust SDK 生成有效的 Rust 代码，减少试验错误，提高开发效率。了解如何设置和使用 Temporal Rust SDK","ja":"Temporal Rust SDK を使用して、Rust コードを効率的に生成します。セットアップ方法とベストプラクティスを学びましょう","ko":"Temporal Rust SDK 를 사용하여 효율적인 Rust 코드를 생성하세요. 설정 방법과 사용법을 알아보세요","es":"Aprende a configurar Temporal Rust SDK para producir código de trabajo con minimal esfuerzo. Descubre los pasos y las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer Temporal Rust SDK pour produire du code de travail avec un minimum d''efforts. Consultez les étapes et les meilleures pratiques.","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Temporal Rust SDK konfigurieren, um funktionierenden Code mit minimalem Aufwand zu erstellen. Entdecken Sie die Schritte und Best Pract...","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Temporal Rust SDK com nosso guia passo a passo e comece a produzir código Rust funcional com mínimo erro","ru":"Изучите руководство по настройке Temporal Rust SDK и начните создавать рабочий код на Rust с минимальными ошибками","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد أداة Temporal Rust SDK بخطوات بسيطة وابدأ في إنتاج رمز Rust قابل للتشغيل بأقل أخطاء"},"definition":{"en":"temporal-rust-sdk is a development tool that enables rapid prototyping of Temporal workflows using Rust, minimizing trial and error.","zh":"Temporal Rust SDK 是一个用于生成 Rust 代码的 AIエージェント","ja":"Temporal Rust SDK は、Rust コードを生成するための AIエージェントです","ko":"Temporal Rust SDK 는 Rust 코드를 생성하는 AI 도구입니다","es":"Temporal Rust SDK es un conjunto de herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial para desarrolladores que necesitan producir código de trabajo para la plataforma Temporal.","fr":"Temporal Rust SDK est un ensemble d''outils d''Intelligence Artificielle pour les développeurs qui ont besoin de produire du code de travail pour la plateforme Temporal.","de":"Temporal Rust SDK ist ein Satz von KI-Tools für Entwickler, die funktionierenden Code für die Temporal-Plattform erstellen müssen.","pt":"O que é Temporal Rust SDK? É uma ferramenta para produzir código Rust funcional para o protótipo SDK do Temporal","ru":"Что такое Temporal Rust SDK? Это инструмент для создания рабочего кода на Rust для прототипа SDK Temporal","ar":"ما هي أداة Temporal Rust SDK? هي أداة لإنشاء رمز Rust قابل للتشغيل لنسخة Прототип SDK من Temporal"},"features":{"en":["Confirms prerequisites using reference/README.md","Reuses worker and starter command flow from examples/","Ports business logic while maintaining Temporal wiring patterns","Runs smoke checks for validation before sharing final code","Utilizes client creation and namespace setup via reference/CLIENT.md"],"zh":["支持 Temporal 原型 SDK","提供最小试验错误的代码生成","包含 Smoke 检查功能","支持 worker 和 starter 命令流","提供 CLIENT.md 和 README.md 参考文档"],"ja":["Temporal プロトタイプ SDK をサポート","最小限の試行錯誤でコードを生成","Smoke チェック機能を含む","worker と starter コマンド フローをサポート","CLIENT.md と README.md リファレンス ドキュメントを提供"],"ko":["Temporal 프로토タイプ SDK 지원","최소한의 시도 오류로 코드 생성","Smoke 체크 기능 포함","worker 및 starter 명령 흐름 지원","CLIENT.md 및 README.md 참조 문서 제공"],"es":["Confirmación de requisitos previos en reference/README.md","Selección de ejemplos ejecutables en examples/","Reutilización del flujo de trabajo y comando de inicio","Portabilidad de la lógica de negocio con patrones de cableado de Temporal","Ejecución de pruebas de humo antes de compartir el código final","Integración con la referencia de cliente en reference/CLIENT.md"],"fr":["Confirmation des conditions préalables dans reference/README.md","Sélection d''exemples exécutables sous examples/","Réutilisation du flux de travail et de la commande de démarrage","Portabilité de la logique métier avec les modèles de câblage de Temporal","Exécution de tests de fumée avant de partager le code final","Intégration avec la référence de client dans reference/CLIENT.md"],"de":["Bestätigung der Voraussetzungen in reference/README.md","Auswahl von ausführbaren Beispielen unter examples/","Wiederverwendung des Arbeitsflusses und des Startkommandos","Portabilität der Geschäftslogik mit Temporal-Verdrahtungsmustern","Ausführung von Rauchtests vor dem Teilen des finalen Codes","Integration mit der Client-Referenz in reference/CLIENT.md"],"pt":["Confirmação de pré-requisitos em reference/README.md","Seleção do exemplo executável mais próximo em examples/","Reutilização do mesmo fluxo de trabalho e comando de inicialização","Portabilidade de lógica de negócios mantendo padrões de fiação do Temporal","Verificação de fumaça antes de compartilhar código final"],"ru":["Подтверждение предварительных требований в reference/README.md","Выбор ближайшего исполняемого примера в examples/","Переиспользование одного и того же потока работы и команды запуска","Перенос бизнес-логики, сохраняя шаблоны подключения Temporal","Проверка дыма перед обменом окончательным кодом"],"ar":["التأكد من المتطلبات المسبقة في reference/README.md","اختيار أقرب مثال قابل للتشغيل في examples/","إعادة استخدام نفس تدفق العمل وأمر التشغيل","نقل منطق الأعمال مع الحفاظ على أنماط توصيل Temporal","فحص الدخان قبل مشاركة الرمز النهائي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use temporal-rust-sdk","temporal-rust-sdk setup guide","temporal-rust-sdk alternative","temporal-rust-sdk vs go-sdk","temporal-rust-sdk install","what is temporal-rust-sdk","temporal workflow development","rust temporal prototype"],"zh":["Temporal Rust SDK","Rust 代码生成","AIエージェント","开发工具","代码效率","试验错误","Smoke 检查","worker 命令流","starter 命令流"],"ja":["Temporal Rust SDK","Rust コード生成","AIエージェント","開発ツール","コード効率","試行錯誤","Smoke チェック","worker コマンド フロー","starter コマンド フロー"],"ko":["Temporal Rust SDK","Rust 코드 생성","AI 도구","개발 도구","코드 효율","시도 오류","Smoke 체크","worker 명령 흐름","starter 명령 흐름"],"es":["Temporal Rust SDK","desarrollo de software","herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial","platorma Temporal","código de trabajo","configuración de SDK","pruebas de humo","referencia de cliente","ejemplos ejecutables"],"fr":["Temporal Rust SDK","développement de logiciels","outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","plateforme Temporal","code de travail","configuration de SDK","tests de fumée","référence de client","exemples exécutables"],"de":["Temporal Rust SDK","Software-Entwicklung","KI-Tools","Temporal-Plattform","funktionierender Code","SDK-Konfiguration","Rauchtests","Client-Referenz","ausführbare Beispiele"],"pt":["temporal rust sdk","guias de configuração","código rust funcional","erro mínimo","protótipo sdk temporal","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["temporal rust sdk","руководство по настройке","рабочий код на rust","минимальные ошибки","прототип sdk temporal","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["temporal rust sdk","دليل الإعداد","رمز روست قابل للتشغيل","أقل أخطاء","نسخة Прототип sdk من Temporal","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Lynskylate","repo":"skillgregistry","repoPath":"Lynskylate/skillgregistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.341Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"temporal-rust-sdk","description":"Provide implementation patterns and runnable examples for the Temporal Rust SDK prototype. Use when building, migrating, or debugging Temporal applications in Rust, including Workflow and Activity authoring, Worker and Client wiring, Signal handling, Local Activities, Saga compensation, and activity registration strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Temporal Rust SDK\n\nUse this skill to produce working Rust code for the Temporal prototype SDK with minimal trial and error.\n\n## Fast path\n\n1. Confirm prerequisites in reference/README.md.\n2. Select the closest runnable example under examples/.\n3. Reuse the same worker and starter command flow.\n4. Port business logic while keeping Temporal wiring patterns.\n5. Run smoke checks before sharing final code.\n\n## Reference router\n\n- reference/CLIENT.md: client creation, namespace setup, workflow start","body":"# Temporal Rust SDK\n\nUse this skill to produce working Rust code for the Temporal prototype SDK with minimal trial and error.\n\n## Fast path\n\n1. Confirm prerequisites in reference/README.md.\n2. Select the closest runnable example under examples/.\n3. Reuse the same worker and starter command flow.\n4. Port business logic while keeping Temporal wiring patterns.\n5. Run smoke checks before sharing final code.\n\n## Reference router\n\n- reference/CLIENT.md: client creation, namespace setup, workflow start, signals, result polling.\n- reference/WORKER.md: worker setup, task queue binding, run loop details.\n- reference/WORKFLOW.md: workflow structure, timers, signal loops, local activities, saga orchestration.\n- reference/ACTIVITY.md: activity contracts, payload boundaries, error handling.\n- reference/ACTIVITY_REGISTRATION.md: activity registration decision matrix and minimal templates.\n\nLoad only the reference file needed for the current task.\n\n## Activity registration rule\n\n1. Default to register_activity_json from src/lib.rs for typed JSON payloads.\n2. Use register_activity macro for short struct method prototypes.\n3. Use raw register_activity only when custom payload encoding or metadata control is required.\n\nKeep request and response structs serde compatible when using helper based registration.\n\n## Smoke check\n\nUse the reusable smoke check script before finalizing updates:\n\n~~~bash\ncd .agent/skills/temporal-rust-sdk\n./scripts/smoke_check.sh\n~~~\n\nUseful options:\n\n~~~bash\n./scripts/smoke_check.sh --all-packages --skip-runtime\n./scripts/smoke_check.sh --package saga --runtime-package saga\n./scripts/smoke_check.sh --dry-run\n~~~\n\nThe script compiles selected example packages and runs a runtime smoke check when a Temporal server is reachable at 127.0.0.1:7233.\n\n## Manual run commands\n\nRun from .agent/skills/temporal-rust-sdk/examples:\n\n~~~bash\ncargo run -p helloworld -- worker\ncargo run -p helloworld -- starter --name Alice\n~~~\n\nPackage names: helloworld, batch-sliding-window, saga, localactivity, struct-activity.\n\n## Implementation checklist\n\n- Set a unique workflow ID for each run.\n- Keep workflow logic deterministic and move side effects to activities.\n- Set explicit activity and local activity timeout policies.\n- Execute saga compensation in reverse order.\n- Keep worker and starter logs for reproducibility.\n\n## Common failure patterns\n\n- Missing protoc causes build failures.\n- Reused workflow IDs cause already running errors.\n- Blocking calls inside workflows can stall task progress.\n- Encoding metadata and payload format mismatches cause decode failures.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:28.177Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing scalable and efficient Temporal workflow implementations in Rust.","zh":"非常适合需要在Rust中实现可扩展和高效的Temporal工作流的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"Rustでスケーラブルで効率的なTemporalワークフローを実装する必要があるワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Rust에서 확장 가능하고 효율적인 Temporal 워크플로우를 구현해야 하는 워크플로우 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de flujo de trabajo que necesitan implementaciones de flujo de trabajo temporales escalables y eficientes en Rust.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de workflow nécessitant des implementations de workflow temporel évolutives et efficaces en Rust.","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die skalierbare und effiziente temporale Workflow-Implementierungen in Rust benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de automação de fluxo de trabalho que precisam de implementações de fluxo de trabalho temporais escaláveis e eficientes em Rust.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, требующих масштабируемых и эффективных реализаций временных рабочих процессов в Rust.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات автомatisation وكفاءة تنفيذ انسياقية زمنية قابلة للتوسيع في Rust."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate working Rust code for the Temporal prototype SDK, leveraging Temporal wiring patterns and minimizing trial and error, with support for client creation, namespace setup, and workflow start via the Temporal Rust SDK.","zh":"赋予代理生成用于Temporal原型SDK的可工作Rust代码的能力，利用Temporal连接模式并最小化试验和错误，并支持客户端创建、命名空间设置和通过Temporal Rust SDK启动工作流。","ja":"TemporalプロトタイプSDK用の動作するRustコードを生成するエージェントを可能にし、Temporalの配線パターンを活用し、試行錯誤を最小限に抑え、クライアントの作成、名前空間の設定、Temporal Rust SDK経由でのワークフローの開始をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Temporal 프로토타입 SDK용으로 작동하는 Rust 코드를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Temporal의 배선 패턴을 활용하고 시도와 오류를 최소화하며, 클라이언트 생성, 네임스페이스 설정 및 Temporal Rust SDK를 통해 워크플로우를 시작하는 것을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar código de trabajo de Rust para el SDK de prototipo de Temporal, aprovechando los patrones de cableado de Temporal y minimizando el error y la prueba, con soporte para la creación de cliente, la configuración de espacio de nombres y el inicio del flujo de trabajo a través del SDK de Rust de Temporal.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du code Rust fonctionnel pour le SDK de prototype Temporal, en exploitant les modèles de câblage Temporal et en minimisant les essais et les erreurs, avec un support pour la création de client, la configuration de l''espace de noms et le démarrage du workflow via le SDK Rust Temporal.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, funktionierenden Rust-Code für das Temporal-Prototyp-SDK zu generieren, indem es die Temporal-Verdrahtungsmuster nutzt und Trial und Error minimiert, mit Unterstützung für Client-Erstellung, Namensraum-Einrichtung und Workflow-Start über das Temporal Rust SDK.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem código Rust funcional para o SDK de protótipo Temporal, utilizando padrões de ligação Temporal e minimizando tentativas e erros, com suporte à criação de clientes, configuração de namespace e início de fluxo de trabalho via o SDK Rust Temporal.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать рабочий код Rust для прототипа SDK Temporal, используя шаблоны подключения Temporal и минимизируя проб и ошибок, с поддержкой создания клиентов, настройки пространства имен и запуска рабочего процесса через SDK Rust Temporal.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من توليد رمز Rust قابل للتشغيل ل SDK النموذج الأولي Temporal، مستخدماً أنماط التوصيل Temporal وتقليل التجارب والخطأ، مع دعم إنشاء العميل، وإعداد مساحة الاسم، وبدء انسياقية العمل عبر SDK Rust Temporal."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workflow implementations with Temporal","Generating scalable Rust code for workflow management","Debugging Temporal workflow issues with smoke checks"],"zh":["使用Temporal实现工作流自动化","为工作流管理生成可扩展的Rust代码","使用冒烟检查调试Temporal工作流问题"],"ja":["Temporalを使用したワークフローの自動化","ワークフローの管理用にスケーラブルなRustコードを生成する","スモークチェックを使用してTemporalワークフローの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["Temporal을 사용한 워크플로우 자동화","워크플로우 관리를 위한 확장 가능한 Rust 코드 생성","스모크 체크를 사용하여 Temporal 워크플로우 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar implementaciones de flujo de trabajo con Temporal","Generar código de Rust escalable para la gestión de flujos de trabajo","Depurar problemas de flujo de trabajo de Temporal con pruebas de humo"],"fr":["Automatiser les implementations de workflow avec Temporal","Générer du code Rust évolutif pour la gestion de workflow","Déboguer les problèmes de workflow Temporal avec des tests de fumée"],"de":["Automatisierung von Workflow-Implementierungen mit Temporal","Generierung von skalierbarem Rust-Code für die Workflow-Verwaltung","Fehlerbehebung bei Temporal-Workflow-Problemen mit Rauchtests"],"pt":["Automatizar implementações de fluxo de trabalho com Temporal","Gerar código Rust escalável para gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho","Depurar problemas de fluxo de trabalho Temporal com verificações de fumaça"],"ru":["Автоматизировать реализации рабочих процессов с помощью Temporal","Генерировать масштабируемый код Rust для управления рабочими процессами","Отлаживать проблемы рабочих процессов Temporal с помощью проверок дыма"],"ar":["أتمتة تنفيذ انسياقية العمل مع Temporal","توليد رمز Rust قابل للتوسيع لإدارة انسياقية العمل","تصحيح أخطاء انسياقية العمل Temporal باستخدام فحوصات الدخان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming language","Temporal prototype SDK prerequisites must be met","Limited to Temporal workflow implementations"],"zh":["需要Rust编程语言","必须满足Temporal原型SDK的先决条件","仅限于Temporal工作流实现"],"ja":["Rustプログラミング言語が必要","TemporalプロトタイプSDKの前提条件を満たす必要がある","Temporalワークフロー実装に限定される"],"ko":["Rust 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","Temporal 프로토타입 SDK의 사전 조건을 충족해야 함","Temporal 워크플로우 구현에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Rust","Los requisitos previos del SDK de prototipo de Temporal deben cumplirse","Limitado a implementaciones de flujo de trabajo de Temporal"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Rust","Les prérequis du SDK de prototype Temporal doivent être remplis","Limité aux implementations de workflow Temporal"],"de":["Benötigt die Rust-Programmiersprache","Die Voraussetzungen für das Temporal-Prototyp-SDK müssen erfüllt werden","Begrenzt auf Temporal-Workflow-Implementierungen"],"pt":["Exige linguagem de programação Rust","Os pré-requisitos do SDK de protótipo Temporal devem ser atendidos","Limitado a implementações de fluxo de trabalho Temporal"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Rust","Предварительные условия прототипа SDK Temporal должны быть выполнены","Ограничен реализациями рабочих процессов Temporal"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة برمجة Rust","يجب 충족 مسبقا ل SDK النموذج الأولي Temporal","محدود بتنفيذ انسياقية العمل Temporal"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7acdf80b5ff36b19cf41d610016239b062e2ff319d9be9a144a1b5d1f66745a0","qualityScore":23}');
