ma minimalista y efectiva","fr":"opence-plan est un ensemble de lignes directrices pour mettre en œuvre les outils d''IA de manière minimaliste et efficace","de":"opence-plan ist ein Satz von Richtlinien für die Implementierung von KI-Agents in minimalistsicher und effektiver Weise","pt":"O Opence-Plan é uma habilidade de desenvolvimento que promove implementações mínimas e evita complexidade desnecessária.","ru":"Opence-Plan - это навык разработки, который пропагандирует минимальные реализации и избегает ненужной сложности.","ar":"Opence-Plan هو مهارة تنمية تعزز التنفيذات المعدلة وتتجنب التعقيد غير الضروري."},"features":{"en":["Implements guardrails for minimal implementations","Scoped changes to requested outcomes","Refers to opence/AGENTS.md for conventions and clarifications","Identifies vague details and prompts follow-up questions","Utilizes ls opence and opence update commands for directory management"],"zh":["遵循简单和可扩展的原则","支持紧密范围的更改","提供清晰的编码约定","支持必要的follow-up问题","参考opence/AGENTS.md文档"],"ja":["シンプルさとスケーラビリティを重視","紧密範囲の変更をサポート","明確なコーディング規約を提供","必要なfollow-up問題をサポート","opence/AGENTS.mdドキュメントを参照"],"ko":["단순성과 확장성을 강조","긴밀한 범위의 변경을 지원","명확한 코딩 규약을 제공","필요한 follow-up 질문을 지원","opence/AGENTS.md 문서를 참조"],"es":["Implementación minimalista y enfocada","Cambios estrechamente definidos para el resultado solicitado","Referencia a las convenciones de opence en AGENTS.md","Identificación de detalles vagos o ambiguos para seguimiento"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre minimaliste et ciblée","Changements étroitement définis pour le résultat demandé","Référence aux conventions d''opence dans AGENTS.md","Identification de détails vagues ou ambigus pour suivi"],"de":["Minimalistische und fokussierte Implementierung","Änderungen eng definiert für das gewünschte Ergebnis","Referenz zu den opence-Konventionen in AGENTS.md","Identifizierung von unklaren oder mehrdeutigen Details für Nachverfolgung"],"pt":["Implementações mínimas","Evita complexidade desnecessária","Referência ao arquivo opence/AGENTS.md","Identificação de detalhes vagos ou ambíguos","Uso do comando opence update"],"ru":["Минимальные реализации","Избегает ненужной сложности","Ссылка на файл opence/AGENTS.md","Определение неясных или двусмысленных деталей","Использование команды opence update"],"ar":["التنفيذات المعدلة","تجنب التعقيد غير الضروري","المرجع إلى ملف opence/AGENTS.md","تحديد التفاصيل الغامضة أو المزدوجة","استخدام الأمر opence update"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use opence-plan","opence-plan setup guide","opence-plan alternative","opence-plan vs other development approaches","opence-plan install","what is opence-plan","opence-plan best practices","opence-plan for AI agents","opence-plan development methodology"],"zh":["Opence-plan","AI工具开发","简单和可扩展","紧密范围的更改","清晰的编码约定","AIエージェント","opence/AGENTS.md"],"ja":["Opence-plan","AIエージェント開発","シンプルさとスケーラビリティ","紧密範囲の変更","明確なコーディング規約","AIツール","opence/AGENTS.md"],"ko":["Opence-plan","AI 에이전트 개발","단순성과 확장성","긴밀한 범위의 변경","명확한 코딩 규약","AI 솔루션","opence/AGENTS.md"],"es":["agentes de IA","herramientas de IA","opence-plan","implementación minimalista","desarrollo de agentes de IA","mejores prácticas para agentes de IA"],"fr":["outils d''IA","agents d''IA","opence-plan","mise en œuvre minimaliste","développement d''outils d''IA","meilleures pratiques pour les outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Agents","KI-Tools","opence-plan","minimalistische Implementierung","Entwicklung von KI-Agents","Best Practices für KI-Agents"],"pt":["opence-plan","desenvolvimento de software","implementações mínimas","complexidade desnecessária","opence/AGENTS.md","comandos opence","desenvolvedores de AI","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["opence-plan","разработка программного обеспечения","минимальные реализации","ненужная сложность","opence/AGENTS.md","команды opence","разработчики ИИ","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["opence-plan","تنمية البرمجيات","التنفيذات المعدلة","التعقيد غير الضروري","opence/AGENTS.md","أوامر opence","مطورو الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات التنمية"]}},"owner":"mufengbufeng","repo":"opence","repoPath":"mufengbufeng/opence","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.374Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opence-plan","description":"Create an opence plan and scaffold change artifacts.","bodyPreview":"<!-- OPENCE:START -->\n**Guardrails**\n- Favor straightforward, minimal implementations first and add complexity only when it is requested or clearly required.\n- Keep changes tightly scoped to the requested outcome.\n- Refer to `opence/AGENTS.md` (located inside the `opence/` directory—run `ls opence` or `opence update` if you don''t see it) if you need additional opence conventions or clarifications.\n- Identify any vague or ambiguous details and ask the necessary follow-up questions before editing","body":"<!-- OPENCE:START -->\n**Guardrails**\n- Favor straightforward, minimal implementations first and add complexity only when it is requested or clearly required.\n- Keep changes tightly scoped to the requested outcome.\n- Refer to `opence/AGENTS.md` (located inside the `opence/` directory—run `ls opence` or `opence update` if you don''t see it) if you need additional opence conventions or clarifications.\n- Identify any vague or ambiguous details and ask the necessary follow-up questions before editing files.\n- Do not write any code during the planning stage. Only create design documents (proposal.md, tasks.md, design.md, and spec deltas). Implementation happens in the work stage after approval.\n\n**Steps**\n1. Review `opence/project.md`, run `opence list` and `opence list --specs`, and inspect related code or docs (e.g., via `rg`/`ls`) to ground the plan in current behaviour; note any gaps that require clarification.\n2. Choose a unique verb-led `change-id` and scaffold `proposal.md`, `tasks.md`, and `design.md` (when needed) under `opence/changes/<id>/`.\n3. Map the change into concrete capabilities or requirements, breaking multi-scope efforts into distinct spec deltas with clear relationships and sequencing.\n4. Capture architectural reasoning in `design.md` when the solution spans multiple systems, introduces new patterns, or demands trade-off discussion before committing to specs.\n5. Draft spec deltas in `changes/<id>/specs/<capability>/spec.md` (one folder per capability) using `## ADDED|MODIFIED|REMOVED Requirements` with at least one `#### Scenario:` per requirement and cross-reference related capabilities when relevant.\n6. Draft `tasks.md` as an ordered list of small, verifiable work items that deliver user-visible progress, include validation (tests, tooling), and highlight dependencies or parallelizable work.\n7. Validate with `opence validate <id> --strict` and resolve every issue before sharing the plan.\n\n**Reference**\n- Use `opence show <id> --json --deltas-only` or `opence show <spec> --type spec` to inspect details when validation fails.\n- Search existing requirements with `rg -n \"Requirement:|Scenario:\" opence/specs` before writing new ones.\n- Explore the codebase with `rg <keyword>`, `ls`, or direct file reads so plans align with current implementation realities.\n<!-- OPENCE:END -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:32.785Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents requiring streamlined development processes with minimal implementations","zh":"非常适合需要简化开发流程和最小化实现的开发者代理","ja":"開発プロセスを簡素化し、実装を最小限に抑える必要がある開発者エージェントに最適","ko":"개발 프로세스를 간소화하고 구현을 최소화해야 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren procesos de desarrollo optimizados con implementaciones mínimas","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur nécessitant des processus de développement rationalisés avec des implementations minimales","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die optimierte Entwicklungsprozesse mit minimalen Implementierungen erfordern","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que requerem processos de desenvolvimento otimizados com implementações mínimas","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, требующих оптимизированных процессов разработки с минимальными реализациями","ar":"مثالي لمراقبي المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى عمليات تطوير مُبسطة مع تنفيذات دنيا"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement straightforward solutions first, adding complexity only when necessary, utilizing guardrails and referring to opence conventions for clarity, ensuring tightly scoped changes and minimal ambiguity","zh":"赋予代理实现直接解决方案的能力，仅在必要时添加复杂性，利用保护栏并参考 opence 约定以确保清晰性，确保范围明确的更改和最小的模糊性","ja":"エージェントが直接的な解決策を実装し、必要な場合のみ複雑性を追加することを可能にし、保護バーを利用し、opence 規約を参照して明確性を確保し、範囲の明確な変更と最小の曖昧性を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 직접적인 해결책을 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 필요한 경우에만 복잡성을 추가하고, 가드레일을 활용하고, opence 규칙을 참조하여 명확성을 보장하며, 범위가 명확한 변경과 최소한의 모호성을 보장","es":"Empodera a los agentes para implementar soluciones sencillas primero, agregando complejidad solo cuando sea necesario, utilizando guardrails y refiriéndose a las convenciones de opence para claridad, asegurando cambios con alcance ajustado y mínima ambigüedad","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour mettre en œuvre des solutions simples en premier, ajoutant de la complexité uniquement lorsque nécessaire, en utilisant des guardrails et en se référant aux conventions de opence pour la clarté, en garantissant des modifications à portée étroite et une ambiguïté minimale","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, einfache Lösungen zuerst zu implementieren und nur bei Bedarf Komplexität hinzuzufügen, indem sie Guardrails verwenden und auf die opence-Konventionen für Klarheit verweisen, um eng gefasste Änderungen und minimale Mehrdeutigkeit sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar soluções diretas primeiro, adicionando complexidade apenas quando necessário, utilizando guardrails e se referindo às convenções opence para clareza, garantindo alterações com escopo definido e ambiguidade mínima","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать простые решения сначала, добавляя сложность только при необходимости, используя guardrails и ссылаясь на конвенции opence для ясности, обеспечивая изменения с четким объемом и минимальной двусмысленностью","ar":"تمكّن المراقبين من تنفيذ حلول مباشرة أولاً، وإضافة تعقيد فقط عند الضرورة، واستخدام حواجز الحماية والاطلاع على اتفاقيات opence لضمان الوضوح، وضمان تغييرات محددة التأسيس وتقليل الالتباس"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing minimal viable products","Refining existing codebases for simplicity","Developing new features with tightly scoped changes"],"zh":["实现最小可行产品","为简单性而改进现有代码库","开发具有紧密范围变化的新功能"],"ja":["最小限の実用製品の実装","既存のコードベースを簡素化する","範囲の明確な変更を持つ新しい機能の開発"],"ko":["최소한의 기능 제품 구현","기존 코드베이스를 단순화하기","명확한 범위의 변경을 갖는 새로운 기능 개발"],"es":["Implementar productos mínimamente viables","Refinar las bases de código existentes para la simplicidad","Desarrollar nuevas características con cambios con alcance ajustado"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des produits mínimalement viables","Affiner les bases de code existantes pour la simplicité","Développer de nouvelles fonctionnalités avec des modifications à portée étroite"],"de":["Implementierung minimaler Produkte","Verfeinerung bestehender Codebasen für Einfachheit","Entwicklung neuer Funktionen mit eng gefassten Änderungen"],"pt":["Implementação de produtos viáveis mínimos","Refinamento de bases de código existentes para simplicidade","Desenvolvimento de novos recursos com alterações de escopo definido"],"ru":["Реализация минимально жизнеспособных продуктов","Уточнение существующих кодовых баз для простоты","Разработка новых функций с изменениями в четком объеме"],"ar":["تنفيذ المنتجات القابلة للبقاء بأدنى حد","تطوير قواعد التعليمات البرمجية الحالية من أجل البساطة","تطوير ميزات جديدة مع تغييرات محددة التأسيس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to opence conventions","Favors minimal implementations over complex solutions"],"zh":["需要遵守 opence 约定","更倾向于最小化实现而不是复杂的解决方案"],"ja":["opence 規約への遵守が必要","複雑な解決策よりも最小限の実装を優先する"],"ko":["opence 규칙을遵守해야 함","복잡한 해결책보다 최소한의 구현을 선호"],"es":["Requiere adherencia a las convenciones de opence","Favorece las implementaciones mínimas sobre las soluciones complejas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion aux conventions de opence","Préfère les implementations minimales aux solutions complexes"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der opence-Konventionen","Favorisiert minimale Implementierungen gegenüber komplexen Lösungen"],"pt":["Exige aderência às convenções opence","Favorece implementações mínimas em vez de soluções complexas"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения конвенций opence","Предпочитает минимальные реализации вместо сложных решений"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام باتفاقيات opence","يفضل التنفيذات الدنيا على حساب الحلول المعقدة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7add8050faa800007310ace5b8455e2df769a390a67c60c4c2cbf47ed000d482","qualityScore":23}');
