INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Swader/proce/progressive-centralization-starter', 'progressive-centralization-starter', 'Swader', 'proce', 'community', 'progressive-centralization-starter Swader proce community The progressive-centralization-starter skill enables developers to scaffold new projects and manage templates using bun run commands. It benefits developers working with web3 and page templates. Progressive Centralization Starter提供了一个快速搭建新项目的方法，包括页面和Web3模板的创建和部署 プログレッシブ・セントラリゼーション・スターターは、新しいプロジェクトを迅速に構築するための方法を提供します。ページとWeb3テンプレートの作成とデプロイが含まれます 진행형 중앙화 스타터는 새로운 프로젝트를 빠르게 구축하는 방법을 제공합니다. 페이지 및 Web3 템플릿의 생성 및 배포가 포함됩니다 Progressive Centralization Starter es una herramienta para scaffold de proyectos, que permite inicializar y configurar proyectos web3 y páginas con facilidad Progressive Centralization Starter est un outil de scaffold de projets, qui permet d''initialiser et de configurer des projets web3 et des pages avec facilité Progressive Centralization Starter ist ein Tool für das Scaffolden von Projekten, das die Initialisierung und Konfiguration von web3-Projekten und Seiten erleichtert O Progressive Centralization Starter é uma ferramenta para inicializar projetos com templates de page e web3, permitindo uma configuração rápida e fácil. Progressive Centralization Starter - это инструмент для инициализации проектов с шаблонами page и web3, позволяющий быстро и легко настроить проект для ИИ Агентов Progressive Centralization Starter هو أداة لتشغيل مشاريع مع قوالب صفحة وويب3، مما يسمح بإعداد سريع وسهل how to use progressive-centralization-starter progressive-centralization-starter setup guide progressive-centralization-starter vs bun progressive-centralization-starter install what is progressive-centralization-starter progressive-centralization-starter alternative bun run commands for progressive-centralization-starter progressive-centralization-starter template management progressive-centralization-starter web3 development Progressive Centralization Starter 页面模板 Web3模板 Bun 新项目搭建 渐进式集中化 Scaffolds new projects using `bun run init` commands Supports web3 and page templates with `--template` option Initializes projects with `bun install` and `.env` configuration Builds and deploys templates using `bun run build` and `bun run deploy` commands Previews templates with `bun run preview` command Manages project setup with `.env.example` and `.env` files progressive-centralization-starter is a skill that provides a foundation for initializing and managing projects with web3 and page templates using bun run commands.');
